niversary Cake</b> is a limited-time object that can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $250. It is a slice of chocolate cake with purple frosting.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Anniversary Cake was only available for two weeks.\n</p><p>After purchase, the player can press E on the cake to eat it. Eating the cake causes it to disappear and plays a heavily distorted \"nom nom nom\" sound effect, before gradually turning the player's vision completely purple. This lasts for 15 seconds, after which the effect fades.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902181052\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019488/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.844      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   32.844      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2134-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902181052 and revision id 12291. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Interactive_Items","Event_Items","Events"],"links":[{"title":"? ? ?","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Anniversary_cake.png"]}
